<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85847" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορφυρ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>purple garment</i> or <i>covering,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.4.6
			</span></i>; distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοινικίς,</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				8.3.3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.55
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. θαλαττία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					38.7.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐξίτηλοι,</span> opp.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀληθιναί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				10.3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				3.196
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Nigr.</u>
				13
			</span></i>,etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a purple-coloured bird,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τανύπτερος ὡς ὅκα π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ibyc.
					4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				304
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				100c2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγχουσα</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠκιμοειδές</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				28
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
